    "title": "Douglas Eggen, Sr. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "19 hours ago Douglas Arnold Eggen, Sr. Doug came into this world on July 19, 1946 in Renton WA to Arnie and Aggie (Rosenstein) Eggen. He joined a brother, Don … two years his elder. The Highands was their home until Doug was nine, at which time Aggie and the boys moved back to her hometown, Enumclaw. His father was a good provider but not what Doug would call a “regular Dad”. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
